•risks related to the Merger including, among others, (i) failure to complete the Merger or unexpected delays related to the Merger, (ii) diversion of management’s attention from ongoing business operations and opportunities, (iii) cost savings and any revenue or expense synergies from the Merger may not be fully realized or may take longer than anticipated to be realized, (iv) expenses related to the Merger are greater than expected, and (v) unanticipated challenges or delays in the integration of Blue Foundry Bank’s business into Fulton Bank’s business and/or the conversion of Blue Foundry Bank’s operating systems and customer data;

