•geopolitical conditions, including acts or threats of terrorism, actions taken by the United States or other governments in response to acts or threats of terrorism and/or military conflicts, including the war between Russia and Ukraine and ongoing tensions in the Middle East, which could impact business and economic conditions in the United States and abroad;

